{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50864","headline":"省题诗二十一首 上巳日曲江锡宴羣臣 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 上巳日曲江锡宴羣臣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"池散暮春景，君垂曦露恩。\n妙音回舜乐，浓味降尧罇。\n诏出倾兰省，筵开对杏园。\n轻涟摇彩舰，芳草映华轩。\n禊事辉朝曲，欢声彻帝门。\n常陪观者列，低首望余暄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50864.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50864","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}